# Future Work

- Implement Firestore real-time snapshot listeners (`on_snapshot`) to stream live terminal updates without polling.
- Integrate role-based authentication and token verification before processing write operations.
- Export filtered audit query batches directly to AWS S3 or GCP Cloud Storage as compressed Parquet files for cold storage.